    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Volumetric source and sink terms that arise as the fluid expands or compresses due to pressure changes.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>this version uses sector-pore volume and total systems compressibilities of rocktypes that are associated with the elements.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>fluid pressure is either taken from the node(FV) or interpolated with the finite-element interpolation to sector integration points. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
